\par 
\par }\pard\plain \s2\widctlpar\outlinelevel1\adjustright \b\f1\fs20\cf1\cgrid {Finally
\par }\pard\plain \widctlpar\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\adjustright \f1\fs20\cf1\cgrid {
\par Any views or suggestions on this application will be gratefully accepted.  This is my first attempt at a major application such as this so I hope you don\rquote t have any problems.
\par 
\par My thanks to Al Richey at [http://members.aol.com/alanrichey/] for writing S5EVENT, which saved me from writing my own code to process key presses and pen events. 
\par 
\par My thanks also to all of you that have already downloaded and used the system.  I hope it is of some benefit to you.
\par 
\par 
\par }\pard\plain \s2\widctlpar\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\outlinelevel1\adjustright \b\f1\fs20\cf1\cgrid {Disclaimer/Other Legal Stuff
